---
description: Hard SEO/Workers indexing guardrails — site origin, GA scripts, trailing slash, og:image, IndexNow, wrangler preview
globs: src/config/**,astro.config.mjs,wrangler.jsonc,public/_redirects,public/**/*.txt,src/components/Analytics.astro,src/components/CookieNotice.astro,src/worker.ts,scripts/audit/**
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow [docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md](docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md) and [docs/CUSTOM-DOMAIN.md](docs/CUSTOM-DOMAIN.md).

- **Site URL:** only `PUBLIC_SITE_URL` / `src/config/defaults.mjs` — never hardcode this site’s `*.workers.dev` host in pages/components.
- **GA:** never put `import` inside `<script define:vars>`; use data-attribute or inline stub + bundled module.
- **Trailing slash:** `src/worker.ts` 308 + `FILE_EXT` `{1,16}`; wrangler `run_worker_first` + `html_handling: force-trailing-slash` + `"previews": {}`.
- **og:image:** no trailing slash on file URLs.
- **IndexNow:** real 32-hex key at `public/<key>.txt`; no `000…0` placeholder.
- **Guides:** ≥800 words, FAQPage, linked from tools via `tool-guide-map.ts`.
- After changes: `npm run build && npm run audit`.
